title:OnboardingStageOne
tags:
---

Welcome to this VR Experience.#line:1

Before we begin we will go through some onboarding exercises to make sure you are happy using the controls. #line:2

Move to the Green Circle in front of you using the thumbstick on the left controller #line:3

===

title:OnboardingStageTwo
